  subtitleEntries:
  - displayStartTime: 0.3
    displayEndTime: 1.35
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: No, I''m good, I''m good.'
  - displayStartTime: 1.75
    displayEndTime: 2.85
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: I am not interested.'
  - displayStartTime: 4.3
    displayEndTime: 5.55
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: We need to get to a duck pond.'
  - displayStartTime: 5.75
    displayEndTime: 7.26
    text: <style="Subtitles_Format_[]>Batman Transition Sound</style>
  - displayStartTime: 7.26
    displayEndTime: 11.5
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: I think the one, the one that
      I''ve never been able to try, as like a meat just at all, is just duck.'
  - displayStartTime: 11.95
    displayEndTime: 12.75
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: I just can''t do it.'
  - displayStartTime: 12.75
    displayEndTime: 13.85
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: I love ducks too much.'
  - displayStartTime: 15.1
    displayEndTime: 15.55
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: Can''t do it.'
  - displayStartTime: 17.55
    displayEndTime: 21.153
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: You see you know how like Gholdengo
      is like a pokemon that''s made of gold coins'
  - displayStartTime: 21.153
    displayEndTime: 24.753
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: and you get a thousand of them
      and then you get like cheese string man?'
  - displayStartTime: 25.606
    displayEndTime: 27.666
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: I''d like to imagine it''s something
      similar.'
  - displayStartTime: 29.091
    displayEndTime: 31.219
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: Oh good lord what''s happening
      here?'
  - displayStartTime: 31.65
    displayEndTime: 34.74
    text: <style="Subtitles_Format_()>Traffic Noises</style>
  - displayStartTime: 34.74
    displayEndTime: 38.45
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: This city is incredibly noisy
      I can barely hear myself think.'
  - displayStartTime: 38.7
    displayEndTime: 40.74
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: Would you <style="YOUTUBE"></style>
      keep it down there?!'
  - displayStartTime: 41.76
    displayEndTime: 42.81
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: Be quiet!'
  - displayStartTime: 43.728
    displayEndTime: 47.45
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Format_()>Loud honking</style>

      <style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>:
      This is...I can''t, I can''t keep this up.'
  - displayStartTime: 48.2
    displayEndTime: 49.9
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Format_()>Loud honking</style>

      <style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>:
      I can''t keep this up. It''s too much.'
  - displayStartTime: 50.25
    displayEndTime: 51.55
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Format_()>Loud honking</style>

      <style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>:
      Let''s see if we can try something else.'
